I won't let you drive the Porsche because you're a terrible driver.
我不會讓你開保時捷 因為你是個很差勁的駕駛

16
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:10,190
There. That wasn't about the wedding.
好了，那跟婚禮的事無關

17
00:01:11,970 --> 00:01:16,670
If you want a ride in the Porsche, I'll take you around the block.
如果你想開保時捷去兜風 我可以載你在街角轉一下

18
00:01:16,870 --> 00:01:18,360
You got a couple hours?
你接下來幾小時都沒事嗎？

19
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:22,300
The One With Chandler's Dad
本集播出：錢德的父親

00:01:23,140 --> 00:01:24,300
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

20
