27
00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:34,710
-She's checking out your beehive. -What?
-她在看你的鳥窩頭 -什麼？

28
00:02:36,020 --> 00:02:37,920
-Give me a brush. -The keys.
-把梳子給我 -鑰匙給我

29
00:02:38,150 --> 00:02:39,710
-No way! -Well, no brush.
-不行 -那我就不給你梳子

30
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:41,860
Fine. It doesn't matter.
好吧，那不重要

31
00:02:42,090 --> 00:02:46,820
If I remember correctly, there's a comb on the floor of the bathroom.
如果我沒記錯 洗手間地上有一把梳子

32
