We still haven't gotten an RSVP from your dad.
你爸還沒寄回函給我們

34
00:03:11,890 --> 00:03:16,410
Oh, right. Maybe that's because I didn't send him an invitation.
喔，對，或許那是因為 我沒寄喜帖給他

35
00:03:17,430 --> 00:03:20,620
He's your father. He should be at our wedding.
他是你爸爸，他應該來 參加我們的婚禮

36
