-a lot the last few years. -What?
-過去幾年來他常常試著跟我聯絡 -什麼？

149
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:42,960
Yeah. He's made phone calls, written letters.
對，他會打電話，寫信給我

151
00:11:43,230 --> 00:11:46,130
He came to New York. I said I was too busy.
他會到紐約來，但我總是說我很忙

152
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:50,060
It's very "Cats in the Cradle." I don't want to get into it.
那就像是「惡意缺席」我真的不想談

153
00:11:52,940 --> 00:11:54,100
Here we go.
節目要開始了

154
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:58,000
Ladies and gentlemen, welcome the incomparable...
各位先生女士，歡迎與世無雙的…

155
00:11:58,250 --> 00:12:00,510
Helena Handbasket.
海蓮娜漢德巴斯奇

156
00:12:04,650 --> 00:12:06,310
Hello, darlings.
嗨，我的小親親們

157
00:12:06,590 --> 00:12:08,020
And there's Daddy.
他就是我爸

158
00:12:16,100 --> 00:12:19,460
Switch places with me. Come on! I'll go under, you go over.
快跟我換位置，快點！ 我在上面，你在下面

159
00:12:19,630 --> 00:12:22,600
-Yeah, I'll get right on that. -Come on!
-對，我願意那麼做 -快點

160
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:25,070
What? No. Hey, Rach, come on.
-什麼？不，瑞秋，別那樣 -快點

161
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:28,010
I'm sure we won't get arrested for this.
我相信我們不會因此被逮捕

163
00:12:34,780 --> 00:12:38,620
Hi, officer. Was I going a little too fast?
嗨，警官，我的速度有點快嗎？

164
00:12:38,820 --> 00:12:40,410
Oh, my God.
喔，我的天啊

165
00:12:41,260 --> 00:12:44,280
-Can I see your license, please? -Absolutely.
-麻煩你把駕照拿出來 -沒問題

166
00:12:44,490 --> 00:12:49,620
It's weird. I had a dream last night that I was stopped by a policeman.
這太奇怪了，我昨晚做了一個夢 夢到我被一個警察攔下來

167
00:12:50,300 --> 00:12:51,420
And then he...
然後他…

168
00:12:51,670 --> 00:12:55,120
Well, I probably shouldn't tell you the rest.
或許我不該告訴你接下來的情節

169
00:12:55,940 --> 00:13:00,670
-Your license. -Yes. Here you go, Officer...
-你的駕照 -對，在這裡，警官…

170
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:02,340
Handsome.
帥哥警官

171
00:13:03,340 --> 00:13:06,510
-It's Hanson. -Oops, sorry. My mistake.
-是韓森才對 -喔，對不起，我看錯了

172
00:13:06,980 --> 00:13:08,680
Dear Lord!
我的天啊！

173
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:12,120
-Wow! -Here it comes.
-哇！ -好了

174
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:14,290
This is a great picture.
這張照片很漂亮

175
00:13:15,660 --> 00:13:19,820
Really? You think so? You know, I had just rolled right out of bed.
真的嗎？你真的那麼想？ 拍照時我才剛剛起床

176
00:13:19,990 --> 00:13:20,980
You look phenomenal.
你看起來很美

177
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:24,130
She should! It was taken 10 years ago!
一點都沒錯，那是十年前的照片了

178
00:13:27,470 --> 00:13:29,560
You know, you probably...
你知道的，或許你很納悶 

179
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:31,770
wonder about the old date.
日期有點不太對勁

180
00:13:32,010 --> 00:13:35,130
Yes. You're an Aquarius, huh?
沒錯，你是水瓶座嗎？

181
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:39,180
-I'll bet you're a Gemini. -No.
-我敢說你是雙子座 -不是

182
00:13:39,410 --> 00:13:40,640
-Taurus? -No.
-金牛座？ -不是

183
00:13:40,850 --> 00:13:42,650
-Virgo? -No.
-處女座？ -不是

184
00:13:42,850 --> 00:13:44,280
-Sagittarius? -Yep.
-射手座？ -對

185
00:13:44,490 --> 00:13:47,280
I knew it. I knew it!
我就知道

186
00:13:47,690 --> 00:13:49,990
You won't speed anymore, right?
不要再超速了，好嗎？ 

187
00:13:50,190 --> 00:13:51,890
I won't speed.
我不會超速的

188
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,590
-Promise to take care of this? -I promise.
-你發誓你會去換駕照？ -我發誓

189
00:13:53,830 --> 00:13:56,190
Let him drive. Does he have a license?
還有，讓他開車，他有駕照嗎？

190
00:13:56,430 --> 00:13:59,020
-Can he handle a stick? -Well...
-他會開手動的車嗎？ -喔…

191
00:13:59,230 --> 00:14:01,790
I can handle a stick!
我會開手動的車！

192
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:21,210
-That can't be your father. -I've been saying that for years.
-他不可能是你爸 -多年來我一直是那麼告訴自己

193
00:14:21,420 --> 00:14:23,580
-Oh, my God! -What?
-喔，我的天啊 -什麼？

194
00:14:23,820 --> 00:14:27,020
That's Mr. Garibaldi playing the piano.
彈鋼琴的人就是嘉利巴迪先生

195
00:14:40,410 --> 00:14:43,070
Hello, and welcome to the show.
嗨，歡迎你們來看表演

196
00:14:43,340 --> 00:14:47,140
I see some of our regulars in the audience.
在觀眾席中我看到一些常客

197
00:14:47,410 --> 00:14:50,650
And a couple of irregulars.
還有一些新面孔

198
00:14:52,390 --> 00:14:56,410
-He's coming into the audience. -Relax. You'll be fine.
-他要走進觀眾席裡了 -放輕鬆，你會沒事的

199
00:14:57,060 --> 00:15:00,150
Oh, much better. You're invisible now.
喔，好多了，現在你成了隱形人

200
00:15:00,860 --> 00:15:03,590
-Where are you from? -Bakersfield.
-你是從哪裡來的？ -貝克斯菲德

201
00:15:03,800 --> 00:15:05,790
-I'm sorry? -Bakersfield.
-對不起？ -貝克斯菲德

202
00:15:06,130 --> 00:15:09,070
No, no, I heard. I'm just sorry.
不，我聽到了，我只是覺得很遺憾

203
00:15:10,470 --> 00:15:12,770
I'll meet you back at the hotel.
我無法接受這種事情 我們回飯店碰面

204
00:15:14,310 --> 00:15:18,510
Look, a standing ovation already. So early in the show.
大家看，已經有人站起來鼓掌 節目才剛剛開始

205
00:15:18,780 --> 00:15:22,680
Turn around, darling. Let me see your pretty face.
轉身吧，親愛的 讓我看看你帥氣的臉

206
00:15:30,890 --> 00:15:34,880
Can we have our drinks, please? Waiter? tress?
我們的飲料能快點送上來嗎？ 服務生？…小姐？

207
00:15:46,670 --> 00:15:48,440
-Hey, Phoebe. -Hey.
-嘿，菲比 -嘿

208
00:15:51,010 --> 00:15:52,210
Check it out.
你看

209
00:15:58,050 --> 00:16:00,150
How much of a man am I?
我很有男子氣概吧？

210
00:16:00,350 --> 00:16:04,980
Wow, nice. Manly, and also kind of a slut.
哇，太棒了，你很有男子氣概 但你也是個蕩婦

211
00:16:06,160 --> 00:16:09,560
I'm beginning to see what Jake was talking about.
我開始瞭解傑克的意思了

212
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,990
The silk feels really good.
絲內褲的感覺真的很舒服

213
00:16:12,730 --> 00:16:17,570
And things aren't as smashed down as I thought they would be.
而那玩意不像我想像中 會擠成一團

214
00:16:17,940 --> 00:16:18,960
That's great.
那真的是太棒了

215
00:16:19,170 --> 00:16:22,970
You have so many more choices than with men's underwear.
而男人的內褲選擇沒那麼多

216
00:16:23,210 --> 00:16:27,510
Bikini, French cut, thong. And the fabrics: cotton, silk, lace.
比基尼，法式剪裁，丁字褲 質料有棉，絲跟蕾絲

217
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:31,340
You know what I've always wondered about? Pantyhose!
你知道我一直想穿什麼嗎？褲襪！

218
00:16:31,550 --> 00:16:35,680
The way they start at your toe, then they go all the way up to..
從腳趾頭開始一路往上拉到…

219
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:43,190
-I should go take these off. -I think it's important you do.
-我應該把內褲脫下來的，對吧？ -我想你最好那麼做

220
00:16:45,370 --> 00:16:46,560
What's your name?
你叫什麼名字？

221
00:16:49,170 --> 00:16:50,360
Chandler.
錢德

222
00:16:52,110 --> 00:16:53,160
Chandler?
錢德？

223
00:16:53,370 --> 00:16:55,600
What an unusual name.
那個名字真是與眾不同

224
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:59,180
You must have had terribly fascinating parents.
你的父母一定很棒

225
00:16:59,380 --> 00:17:01,350
Oh, they're a hoot.
喔，他們只會大喊大叫的

226
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:05,210
And who is your friend?
你的朋友叫什麼名字？

227
00:17:05,690 --> 00:17:07,280
I'm Monica.
我是摩妮卡

228
00:17:08,490 --> 00:17:12,050
-Monica. Where are you from? -New York.
-摩妮卡，你們從哪裡來的？ -紐約

229
00:17:12,260 --> 00:17:17,390
I'm not very fond of New York. Queens, I like.
我不太喜歡紐約 但我喜歡皇后區

231
00:17:20,100 --> 00:17:21,620
What is this...
這個亮晶晶的…

232
00:17:22,100 --> 00:17:25,870
sparkling something, honey, huh?
東西是什麼？甜心

233
00:17:27,110 --> 00:17:29,910
Actually, Monica and I are engaged.
事實上摩妮卡跟我訂婚了

234
00:17:31,110 --> 00:17:32,140
Really?
真的嗎？

235
00:17:33,410 --> 00:17:34,940
Congratulations.
恭喜你們

236
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:37,810
When's the big day?
你們什麼時候結婚？

237
00:17:39,750 --> 00:17:41,580
In two weeks.
兩星期後

238
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:44,020
I see.
我知道了

239
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:50,320
Well, I wish you both a lifetime of happiness.
喔，我祝你們兩個永遠幸福

240
00:17:51,300 --> 00:17:52,730
So, you're bald.
原來你是個禿頭

241
00:17:53,530 --> 00:17:54,520
Wait, wait.
等一下

242
00:17:57,910 --> 00:18:00,430
We'd love it if you could be there.
我們希望你能來參加我們的婚禮

243
00:18:02,740 --> 00:18:03,840
Really?
真的嗎？

244
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:08,280
I know it would make me happy...
我知道那會讓我覺得很快樂…

245
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:10,970
ma'am.
夫人

246
00:18:13,590 --> 00:18:16,150
Then I wouldn't miss it for the world.
我一定會去的

247
00:18:17,620 --> 00:18:20,150
I'm getting all misty here.
我都熱淚盈眶了

248
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:24,550
You'd think I was having my legs waxed or something.
你們一定會以為 我剛剛用熱蠟除過腿毛

249
00:18:28,070 --> 00:18:29,760
-You okay? -Yeah.
-你還好嗎？ -我很好

250
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:33,300
Thanks for making me do this.
謝謝你逼我這麼做

251
00:18:34,270 --> 00:18:38,970
Before we go on with the show, I want to say to the bride and groom...
在繼續表演前，我要跟這對新人說…

252
00:18:39,180 --> 00:18:42,270
how lucky they are to have found each other.
他們非常幸運能找到彼此

253
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:45,180
In every life a little rain must fall.
每個人的人生都會遇到雨天

254
00:18:45,390 --> 00:18:46,680
Fortunately...
還好…

255
00:18:46,890 --> 00:18:48,720
in my life...
在我的人生中…

256
00:19:03,540 --> 00:19:07,170
When I was growing up, I played the one on the far left.
我小時候演過最左邊那個角色

257
00:19:18,620 --> 00:19:20,680
Remind me to introduce you to someone.
提醒我介紹你給某人認識

258
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:22,320
-Who? -Fourth gear.
-誰？ -四檔

259
00:19:26,190 --> 00:19:29,560
What does he want? I wasn't doing anything.
他想做什麼？我什麼都沒做

260
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:34,890
Maybe he saw your hands slip briefly from the 10 and 2:00 position.
或許他看到你的手 只會從十點的位置滑到兩點的位置

261
00:19:36,770 --> 00:19:41,210
Maybe it's Sergeant Sagittarius coming back to flirt some more.
或許是射手座警官 折回來想泡你

262
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:45,840
It's a different guy.
不是剛剛那個警官

263
00:19:48,580 --> 00:19:52,250
-Good evening, sir. -Do you know how fast you were going?
-晚安，警官 -你知道你的時速有多快嗎？

264
00:19:52,450 --> 00:19:56,180
No, I don't, but it couldn't have been more than 60.
不，我不知道 但應該沒有超過六十里

265
00:19:56,390 --> 00:19:58,150
You're right. It was 37.
你說的對，只有三十七里

266
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:06,430
You're not ticketing me for driving too slow, are you?
你該不會因為我開得太慢 要開我罰單吧？

267
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:08,760
That's right.
沒錯

268
00:20:17,040 --> 00:20:18,570
You know, officer...
你知道的，警官…

269
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:22,770
I had the weirdest dream last night.
昨晚我做了一個非常奇怪的夢

270
00:20:22,980 --> 00:20:24,380
Oh, my God!
喔，我的天啊！

271
00:20:25,790 --> 00:20:27,120
Your license, please.
麻煩你把駕照拿出來

272
00:20:28,820 --> 00:20:32,190
You don't want to hear about my dream...
你不想聽聽我做了什麼夢…

273
00:20:32,390 --> 00:20:33,550
Officer...
警官…

274
00:20:34,130 --> 00:20:35,490
Pretty?
英俊警官

275
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:40,400
It's Petty.
是佩堤警官才對

276
00:20:42,270 --> 00:20:44,740
I'll be right back with your ticket.
我馬上幫你開罰單

277
00:20:47,310 --> 00:20:50,330
-You have a son. -I know. I know.
-你有個兒子 -我知道

278
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:58,750
-Feel better? -Yeah. Much.
-你覺得好一點了嗎？ -對，我好多了

279
00:21:00,090 --> 00:21:01,210
Listen...
聽著…

280
00:21:01,660 --> 00:21:05,750
Not that I'm insecure about my manhood or anything, but...
我並不是擔心我的男子氣概…

281
00:21:07,090 --> 00:21:09,960
I need to hook up with a woman right now.
但我想我應該馬上去泡個女人

282
00:21:10,500 --> 00:21:11,660
I understand.
我瞭解

283
00:21:19,940 --> 00:21:22,600
You look familiar. Do I know you?
你看起來好眼熟，我認識你嗎？

284
00:21:22,840 --> 00:21:24,110
I don't think so.
應該不認識

285
00:21:24,310 --> 00:21:26,750
Maybe it's because I'm on television.
或許那是因為我是電視演員

286
00:21:28,850 --> 00:21:32,750
-I'm an actor on Days of our Lives. -Wow. Really?
-我演出《我們的日子》 -哇，真的嗎？

287
00:21:32,950 --> 00:21:35,750
-$4.50, please. -Oh, let me get this.
-一共是四塊半，謝謝 -喔，讓我來吧

288
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:47,960
These are for you.
這是送你的

289
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


290
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

